  "summary_en": "Japan's National Strategic Special Zones Act (Act No. 107 of 2013, current revision effective 2026-07-31) creates special zones for regulatory exemptions to boost industrial competitiveness. It includes data-linkage infrastructure for advanced AI/IoT use and innovative technology demonstrations (Arts. 25-2 onward) allowing special-specification vehicles, drones and radio experiments under approved zone plans.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Establishes national strategic special zones with Cabinet-approved basic policy and zone plans",
   "Regulatory exemption measures for approved specific projects in zones",
   "Defines advanced regional data utilization using AI, IoT and cloud, with a data-linkage platform",
   "Innovative technology demonstration plans (Art. 25-2 to 25-6) cover special-specification vehicle operation, drones and radio experiments with safety conditions and revocation",
   "Advisory Council and zone councils oversee plan evaluation"
  ],
